  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place the banana on any plate that follows its curves. Cut in half using a sharp knife. Place scoops of ice cream in the middle and at each end of the banana. Place ice cream-sized scoops of whipped cream swirls between the ice cream scoops.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt 3 of the chocolate chunks in a microwave-safe bowl in the microwave. Pour on top of the split. Sprinkle raspberries on top, followed by remaining chocolate chunks.",
